1
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:05,541
To our grand harvest!

2
00:00:05,541 --> 00:00:08,875
After tonight, the entire Golantis Continent 

3
00:00:08,875 --> 00:00:11,250
will bow before the House of Morellan!

4
00:00:11,250 --> 00:00:13,000
But that won't
stop us from celebrating!

5
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:15,750
So, to every great
house in this room!

6
00:00:45,958 --> 00:00:48,041
Who the freak are you?

7
00:00:50,125 --> 00:00:53,500
Black Dragon Covenant.

8
00:01:13,083 --> 00:01:15,041
Those bastards want to erase

9
00:01:15,041 --> 00:01:16,291
all four families from the map!

10
00:01:16,291 --> 00:01:17,958
They're demanding two billion tons of ore.

11
00:01:17,958 --> 00:01:19,500
Even if I
bleed my mines dry,

12
00:01:19,500 --> 00:01:21,041
I can't pull
together half of that!

13
00:01:21,041 --> 00:01:22,000
They command the most ruthless

14
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:23,750
Dragon Legion on Golantis.

15
00:01:23,750 --> 00:01:25,500
They've crushed over a dozen border kingdoms

16
00:01:25,500 --> 00:01:26,208
without losing once.

17
00:01:26,208 --> 00:01:27,625
We don't stand a chance.

18
00:01:27,625 --> 00:01:29,125
You're the strongest house here, Morellan.

19
00:01:29,125 --> 00:01:30,333
Tell me you've got
a way out of this!

20
00:01:30,958 --> 00:01:32,875
There is only one
man on Golantis 

21
00:01:32,875 --> 00:01:34,875
who might be able
to stop what's coming.

22
00:01:36,291 --> 00:01:37,291
Who?

23
00:01:37,291 --> 00:01:39,958
The Lord of the
Sovereign Sanctum.

24
00:01:41,625 --> 00:01:43,250
The Godfather.

25
00:01:44,875 --> 00:01:46,041
- The Godfather?
- The Godfather?

26
00:01:46,041 --> 00:01:47,166
You mean, the one...

27
00:01:47,500 --> 00:01:49,541
the alchemists, beast tamers, mages, 

28
00:01:49,541 --> 00:01:51,083
and even the Assassin's Guild answers to.

29
00:01:51,083 --> 00:01:52,416
That Godfather?

30
00:02:10,791 --> 00:02:13,333
No one can disturb my seclusion.
